<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-DRAW FOR STANDARD BANK CUP ANNOUNCED.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-DRAW FOR STANDARD BANK CUP ANNOUNCED.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The draw for the semi-final of the Standard Bank cricket cup is as follows:</p>
<p>Natal v Mashonoland (April 18) and Northern Transvaal or Griqualand West v Western Province (April 20).</p>
</text>
